# Paths under services/agent/ that are NOT built into the vss-agent image.
#
# The Dockerfile (services/agent/docker/Dockerfile) uses selective COPY of the
# real build inputs (pyproject.toml, uv.lock, src/, docker/, 3rdparty/, license
# files). Everything listed here — unit tests, docs, CI metadata — never enters
# the container, so changing it must NOT flip the "Check vss-agent tag source"
# container-source check.
#
# Format: gitignore-style, paths relative to services/agent/. Used by
# .github/scripts/check_container_tag_source.py to decide whether a folder
# tree-SHA difference is source-relevant. NOTE: src/**/*.md IS shipped (COPY of
# src/), so only the service-root docs are ignored here — not src/ docs.
tests/
stubs/
README.md
AGENTS.md
LICENSE.md
.gitattributes
.gitleaks.toml
.secrets.baseline
gitleaks-baseline.json
.ignore_source_code_check
